# Strict ingest records a diversion but commits the entry as well, so the view
# folds a value it should never have seen.
MODULE: RejectedContributesNothingDivertCommits
TARGET: RejectedContributesNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a strict-ingest diversion is also committed
PERTURBS: Replicate
BOUNDS: StrictIngest = TRUE

--- FIND
          /\ IF diverted
             THEN UNCHANGED <<wal, stored, intended>>
--- REPLACE
          /\ IF FALSE
             THEN UNCHANGED <<wal, stored, intended>>
--- END
